---
// src/components/ssd/ArchitectureDetail.astro
// Technical explanation of the NL-to-SQL pipeline.
---

<div class="space-y-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-4 border border-border rounded bg-bg">
            <div class="text-accent font-bold mb-2">1. Semantic Mapping</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">User queries are processed through an embedding layer. "Pollock" is mapped to the canonical term "минтай" using cosine similarity in a vector space.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border border-border rounded bg-bg">
            <div class="text-accent font-bold mb-2">2. Contextual Prompting</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">The LLM receives a detailed schema context (SCD) including table definitions and business rules (e.g., "Don't sum onboard totals").</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 border border-border rounded bg-bg">
            <div class="text-accent font-bold mb-2">3. Safe Execution</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">Generated SQL is wrapped in a read-only subquery with a hard LIMIT to prevent resource exhaustion and ensure security.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-bg border border-border rounded-lg p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-4 text-accent">The Prompt Engine</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">The system uses a strictly constrained system prompt to ensure the LLM acts as a pure SQL translator without "conversational noise".</p>
                <pre class="bg-surface p-3 rounded text-[10px] font-mono text-text-muted border border-border overflow-x-auto">
_SYSTEM = """
Ты аналитик данных рыбопромышленной отрасли.
Переводи вопрос пользователя в SQL-запрос для DuckDB.

Правила:
- Только SELECT или WITH ... SELECT.
- Ответь ТОЛЬКО SQL — без markdown, пояснений.
- Если невозможно — ответь: НЕВОЗМОЖНО: &lt;причина&gt;
"""
                </pre>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <p class="text-sm text-text-muted">Schema context is provided dynamically, enabling the LLM to understand the difference between daily "catch" and static "onboard" totals.</p>
                <pre class="bg-surface p-3 rounded text-[10px] font-mono text-text-muted border border-border overflow-x-auto">
### catch — дневной вылов
  file_date TEXT, vessel TEXT, zone TEXT, 
  species_canon TEXT, qty_t DOUBLE
⚠ qty_t — суточный поток; SUM(qty_t) 
за период = суммарный вылов.
                </pre>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
